\item \strong{Staying.} Everyone \code{"active"} in a snapshot other than the last is
exposed, at their whole years of tenure. \code{px} is the share still
active at the next snapshot, from \code{\link[=estimate_decrement_rates]{estimate_decrement_rates()}} with
tenure in place of age.
\item \strong{Pay growth.} Among those who stayed and had pay in both years, the
change in pay from one year to the next: \code{pay_growth}, with
